{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Operation Purge</i> is a sci-fi survival game that follows a storyline centered around an astronaut as the main character. We arrive on Titan, one of Saturn\u2019s moons, where the protagonist crash-lands due to a storm and must investigate a mysterious event alone. He has to face the harsh conditions of the moon, and gradually it becomes clear that he is not alone. He must search for various tools among the wreckage, restart and repair certain devices \u2014 all while the clock is ticking, and oxygen and food supplies are running low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive long enough to find the truth?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863450?t=1760390701","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863450/33928971d466b8ba9618d7cc67cfd10390f239c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760390701","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863450/ca14838797d811b8504a06e5fb2543887d5c59d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760390701","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863450/ca14838797d811b8504a06e5fb2543887d5c59d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760390701","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Visible blood, bloodstains, and disturbing, horror-themed environments and sounds."},"demos":[{"appid":3980640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Operation Purge</i> is a sci-fi survival game that follows a storyline centered around an astronaut as the main character. We arrive on Titan, one of Saturn\u2019s moons, where the protagonist crash-lands due to a storm and must investigate a mysterious event alone. He has to face the harsh conditions of the moon, and gradually it becomes clear that he is not alone. He must search for various tools among the wreckage, restart and repair certain devices \u2014 all while the clock is ticking, and oxygen and food supplies are running low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive long enough to find the truth?</p>","developers":["StellarGamesStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863450/211158c1b5db708d62990eb6c28e3363c2516f29/header.jpg?t=1760390701","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3863450/232777310/25f263cc5e30655e79e329577134da38c5109009/1756725296/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756726308","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3863450/232777310/25f263cc5e30655e79e329577134da38c5109009/1756725296/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756726308","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3863450/232777310/25f263cc5e30655e79e329577134da38c5109009/1756725296/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756726308","id":257189947,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189947/movie480.mp4?t=1756726308","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189947/movie_max.mp4?t=1756726308"},"name":"Operation Purge teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189947/b45622cbb305c8eac157701a7602a19263a8e32e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756726308","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189947/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756726308","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189947/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756726308"}}],"name":"Operation Purge","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min